@NominationsApi_HostAddress = http://localhost:5034

### List all nominations
GET {{NominationsApi_HostAddress}}/api/nominations
Accept: application/json

###

### Get nomination by ID
GET {{NominationsApi_HostAddress}}/api/nominations/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create a nomination
POST {{NominationsApi_HostAddress}}/api/nominations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipperId": "SHIPPER-A",
  "pipelineSegment": "MAINLINE-NORTH",
  "requestedVolume": 500.0
}

###

### Create a second nomination on the same segment
POST {{NominationsApi_HostAddress}}/api/nominations
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipperId": "SHIPPER-B",
  "pipelineSegment": "MAINLINE-NORTH",
  "requestedVolume": 750.0
}

###

### Update a nomination
PUT {{NominationsApi_HostAddress}}/api/nominations/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "shipperId": "SHIPPER-A",
  "pipelineSegment": "MAINLINE-NORTH",
  "requestedVolume": 600.0,
  "status": "Pending"
}

###

### Delete a nomination
DELETE {{NominationsApi_HostAddress}}/api/nominations/1

###

### Schedule a segment (total 1250 > capacity 1000 — proportional cut)
POST {{NominationsApi_HostAddress}}/api/nominations/schedule/MAINLINE-NORTH
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "capacity": 1000.0
}

###
